 y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3DD9C7" stop-opacity="0.28"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#3DD9C7" stop-opacity="0"></stop></linearGradient></defs><polygon points="6,55 6,50 47.6,46.17391304347826 89.2,38.24844720496894 130.8,28.13664596273292 172.4,17.47826086956522 214,6 214,55" fill="url(#sp-cash-g)"></polygon><polyline points="6,50 47.6,46.17391304347826 89.2,38.24844720496894 130.8,28.13664596273292 172.4,17.47826086956522 214,6" fill="none" stroke="#3DD9C7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></polyline><circle cx="214" cy="6" r="4" fill="#3DD9C7" stroke="#F1F4F7" stroke-width="2" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></circle></svg><span class="panel-stat__foot">collected across all sources</span></div></div><div class="momentum__foot"><span class="k">Traced to LexCollect</span><strong class="v">every dollar</strong><span class="s">each payment carries its origin, message and outcome</span></div></figure></div><figcaption>Illustrative six-month trend. In the product this view is your firm&#x27;s live data.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="section section--light ab-story" id="story"><div class="container"><div class="ab-story__grid"><div class="ab-story__lead" data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><blockquote class="ab-quote">The partners didn&#x27;t need a prettier report. They needed one number they could trust, and a way to reconnect with the clients behind it.</blockquote><p class="ab-quote__cite">Why LexCollect exists</p></div><ol class="ab-chapters"><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="0"><span class="ab-chapters__kicker">Before</span><h3>Five systems, each right about its own piece</h3><p>The firm ran MyCase, then Filevine, took payments through LawPay, tracked leads in HubSpot and closed the books in QuickBooks. None of them agreed about the whole, and the “true AR” lived in a spreadsheet someone rebuilt from raw exports every month.</p></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="100"><span class="ab-chapters__kicker">What we built</span><h3>The thing in the middle</h3><p>It reconciled a $21M book to the firm&#x27;s own ground truth, found hundreds of contracts marked paid that weren&#x27;t, re-linked $3.5M of balances to the right clients, and replaced rounds of calls with reconciled lists, automated email and SMS, and a record of every contact.</p></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="200"><span class="ab-chapters__kicker">What came next</span><h3>Queues, a certified number, other firms</h3><p>Escalations moved out of email and into queues with owners. The partners got a certified number every month. Then other firms asked for it. That&#x27;s LexCollect.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class="section ab-outcomes" id="outcomes"><div class="container"><div class="hm-roles__head" data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">What we care about</p><h2>Eight outcomes, not eight features.</h2><p class="lead">Every part of the platform exists to move one of these. If it doesn&#x27;t, we don&#x27;t build it.</p></div><ol class="hm-roles__grid ab-outcomes__grid"><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="0"><span class="hm-role__who">01</span><h3>Maximize revenue</h3><p>Collect more of what was already billed, add paying clients, and see which products to sell more of.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="70"><span class="hm-role__who">02</span><h3>Financial visibility</h3><p>One reconciled, certified view of receivables across every system.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="140"><span class="hm-role__who">03</span><h3>Recover hard debt</h3><p>A prioritized queue, sequences instead of call rounds, promises that get followed, and failed cards handled gently.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="210"><span class="hm-role__who">04</span><h3>Accountability</h3><p>Every team member measured from the full record, every day.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="0"><span class="hm-role__who">05</span><h3>Internal communication</h3><p>Escalations with queues, priorities and owners instead of email chains.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="70"><span class="hm-role__who">06</span><h3>Client trust</h3><p>The connection between firm and client, rebuilt: nobody is chased for money they already paid.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="140"><span class="hm-role__who">07</span><h3>Products &amp; lifecycle</h3><p>Cash by product and where in an engagement&#x27;s life it arrives.</p></li><li class="hm-role" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="210"><span class="hm-role__who">08</span><h3>Works with your CRM</h3><p>Any CRM that exports or has an API. Leads validated by money, and a client 360 the books agree with.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="section section--light ab-principles" id="principles"><div class="container"><div class="ab-principles__grid"><div class="ab-principles__head" data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Principles</p><h2>How we work.</h2><p class="lead">Four rules every number, message and cleanup has to pass before it reaches a partner or a client.</p></div><ol class="ab-principles__list"><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="0"><span class="ab-principles__num">01</span><div><h3>Reconcile before you collect</h3><p>A message built on unreconciled data wastes the firm&#x27;s credibility and the client&#x27;s trust. We tie every dollar to a client, contract and invoice before anyone is contacted.</p></div></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="80"><span class="ab-principles__num">02</span><div><h3>Every finding has a price and an owner</h3><p>A cause, a record count, a dollar figure and a name. If we can&#x27;t put a price on a problem, we say so instead of guessing.</p></div></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="160"><span class="ab-principles__num">03</span><div><h3>Measure people from the full record</h3><p>Scorecards come from every logged contact, not a sample. The first firm&#x27;s old dashboard showed 8% of real activity. Ours certifies the whole thing.</p></div></li><li data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="240"><span class="ab-principles__num">04</span><div><h3>Trust comes from checking</h3><p>Cleanups verify themselves against ground truth. Payments can&#x27;t book twice. Every merge is audited and reversible. A green status means the job really ran.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section><section class="section section--deep ab-serve" id="who"><div class="container"><div class="ab-serve__grid"><div data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Who we serve</p><h2>Firms past the point of keeping receivables in someone&#x27;s head.</h2><p class="lead">Mid-size and growing firms with payment plans, multiple systems and someone chasing late accounts, but no finance department to chase every dollar full time.</p><p class="muted">The first deployment was a firm with thousands of installment plans and payers who weren&#x27;t the client, which is the hardest version of the problem. The system fits any firm that bills.</p></div><div class="ab-fit" data-fit="true" data-fit-labels="Tick what&#x27;s true for your firm.|Worth a conversation.|A good fit.|A strong fit.|Built for firms like yours." data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="120"><p class="ab-fit__title">Is LexCollect a fit?</p><ul><li><label><input type="checkbox" name="fit-0"/><span>We bill clients and carry receivables</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox" name="fit-1"/><span>We run payment plans or installments</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox" name="fit-2"/><span>Our systems don&#x27;t agree on what we&#x27;re owed</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox" name="fit-3"/><span>Someone on our team chases late accounts by hand</span></label></li></ul><div class="ab-fit__foot"><span class="ab-fit__result" data-fit-result="true" aria-live="polite">Tick what&#x27;s true for your firm.</span><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="<?php echo esc_url( lexcollect_booking_url() ); ?>">Book a call <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Book a call</p><h2>See what your own numbers say.</h2><p class="lead">One conversation, your systems, and a first look at what&#x27;s late, what&#x27;s unmatched and what&#x27;s recoverable now.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="<?php echo esc_url( lexcollect_booking_url() ); ?>">Book a call <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
